If the current route table cannot be read, report the limitation and do not ping a guessed address.

A gateway ping must use the gateway verified for the current EJII host environment.

Keep host-local information distinct from information about the end user's device when EJII is running on a remote server or in a container.

This distinction is essential. The server running EJII is not necessarily the same machine from which the browser is connecting.

